WEBVTT

00:07.284 --> 00:07.984
It was the day of the supplementary class.
The weather was deep into the fall.

00:07.984 --> 00:12.322
It was the day of the supplementary class.
The weather was deep into the fall.

00:24.534 --> 00:24.768
Maho!

00:24.768 --> 00:25.769
Maho!

00:32.609 --> 00:36.813
Roll cake Sunday, sandwich Monday

00:36.813 --> 00:40.684
Just go with how you feel

00:40.684 --> 00:44.821
Half in expectation and even in odds

00:44.821 --> 00:48.425
Tomorrow starts now

00:48.425 --> 00:49.693
Cats

00:49.693 --> 00:50.393
Cats

00:50.393 --> 00:51.661
And silver grass

00:51.661 --> 00:52.329
And silver grass

00:52.329 --> 00:56.433
Are beckoning

00:56.433 --> 00:57.601
There's nothing

00:57.601 --> 00:58.368
There's nothing

00:58.368 --> 00:59.603
It's boring

00:59.603 --> 01:00.303
It's boring

01:00.303 --> 01:04.262
Goodbye for today

01:05.742 --> 01:08.245
It goes around, goes round and round

01:08.245 --> 01:09.679
It goes around, goes round and round

01:09.679 --> 01:12.182
I'm the Sun

01:12.182 --> 01:13.683
I'm the Sun

01:13.683 --> 01:16.119
It goes around, goes round and round

01:16.119 --> 01:17.621
It goes around, goes round and round

01:17.621 --> 01:20.056
Even the green train, too

01:20.056 --> 01:21.391
Even the green train, too

01:21.391 --> 01:23.994
It goes around, goes round and round

01:23.994 --> 01:25.495
It goes around, goes round and round

01:25.495 --> 01:27.930
It keeps on spinning

01:29.432 --> 01:40.944
Even the sky and the stars are a roulette theater

01:40.944 --> 01:42.275
Huh?

01:44.481 --> 01:45.248
We're the All-Japan Bancho Association!

01:45.248 --> 01:47.717
We're the All-Japan Bancho Association!

01:48.084 --> 01:50.109
This is Animal Bancho Hirosuke!

01:50.187 --> 01:52.522
He's the shock troop commander
of the Bancho Association!

01:52.522 --> 01:54.024
Dabesa.

01:54.024 --> 01:56.159
This is female ninja bancho Ogin!

01:56.159 --> 01:58.829
She's a bit sentimental and 17 years old!

01:58.829 --> 02:00.456
And!

02:02.632 --> 02:04.568
This is the guardian god
of the Bancho Association!

02:04.568 --> 02:06.570
Giant Bancho Fujiyama Ichiban!

02:06.570 --> 02:09.139
WHAT'S UP, Y'ALL?

02:09.139 --> 02:11.471
That day, our school came
under attack by Bancho.

02:11.908 --> 02:17.005
Where is the little kid bancho who's
been running things around here lately?

02:19.282 --> 02:20.650
What? Me?!

02:20.650 --> 02:23.320
So you're the little kid bancho?

02:23.320 --> 02:26.790
Now fight me fair and square, dabesa, Bancho!

02:26.790 --> 02:28.859
Bancho?

02:28.859 --> 02:30.260
All right, just do it!

02:30.260 --> 02:31.194
Do what?!

02:31.194 --> 02:31.428
Do what?!

02:31.428 --> 02:31.690
Do what?!

02:33.296 --> 02:41.238
Anyway, I've asked those who scored the lowest
in the routine exams to gather here today...

02:41.238 --> 02:45.041
Rei, Miyako, No. 6, Ichijo...

02:45.041 --> 02:47.110
What are you guys doing here?

02:47.110 --> 02:49.145
I had nothing else to do.

02:49.145 --> 02:52.082
Miyako and No. 6 are here because I asked
them if they wanted to come and they said yes.

02:52.082 --> 02:52.749
Yes!

02:52.749 --> 02:55.785
That's not why I'm here! I was FORCED to come!

02:55.785 --> 02:56.887
How about you, Ichijo?

02:56.887 --> 02:57.287
How about you, Ichijo?

02:57.287 --> 03:00.313
I stood up for world peace.

03:00.690 --> 03:02.926
I was stupid for asking.

03:02.926 --> 03:04.761
I stood up.

03:04.761 --> 03:07.330
All right, all right, just sit down.

03:07.330 --> 03:11.892
Hey, Shiratori, will you wake up Himeko?
She's asleep already.

03:13.436 --> 03:14.699
Okay!

03:14.938 --> 03:17.566
WAKE-UP CHOP!

03:22.212 --> 03:24.814
It was obvious you picked
the wrong person for that.

03:24.814 --> 03:27.851
Well, I'm going to start the class now.

03:27.851 --> 03:29.052
Mesousa, the pedestal!

03:29.052 --> 03:29.352
Mesousa, the pedestal!

03:29.352 --> 03:30.754
Yes.

03:32.322 --> 03:32.889
Huh?

03:32.889 --> 03:33.185
Huh?

03:37.093 --> 03:38.228
Wh-What's that?

03:38.228 --> 03:39.462
Something exploded!

03:39.462 --> 03:40.363
Was it gunfire?

03:40.363 --> 03:41.531
Is this a war?

03:41.531 --> 03:43.133
What in the heck are they thinking?

03:43.133 --> 03:44.768
This is a school, for goodness sake!

03:44.768 --> 03:46.862
Um, before that, please look over here...

03:50.573 --> 03:51.775
What is that?!

03:51.775 --> 03:53.470
Please help me!

03:54.044 --> 03:55.978
Rewinding...

03:59.182 --> 04:01.284
What do you think I should do?

04:01.284 --> 04:02.686
Like I said, you should just go!

04:02.686 --> 04:05.722
She's right! You should fight them
like a genius should!

04:05.722 --> 04:08.124
I don't want to! What do you mean
“"like a genius should" anyway?!

04:09.726 --> 04:10.226
But before that,

04:10.226 --> 04:11.261
But before that,

04:11.261 --> 04:13.430
don't you think there's
something else to consider?

04:13.430 --> 04:13.563
Don't you think there's
something else to consider?

04:13.563 --> 04:16.599
Something else to consider?
What would that be?

04:16.599 --> 04:20.403
Huh? Think about it! That guy is,
like, ten meters tall!

04:20.403 --> 04:21.972
Yeah, he is.

04:21.972 --> 04:22.439
On top of that he's a cow, you know?

04:22.439 --> 04:24.007
On top of that he's a cow, you know?

04:24.007 --> 04:25.275
He's got a bazooka, you know?

04:25.275 --> 04:26.409
So?

04:26.409 --> 04:27.310
What?

04:27.310 --> 04:29.312
Uh, so...

04:29.312 --> 04:34.217
Kurumi! Don't look away from reality!
Get a hold of yourself! Okay?

04:34.217 --> 04:37.053
Um, that's not exactly it...

04:37.053 --> 04:39.222
I WAS being realistic...

04:39.222 --> 04:41.020
Becky, look!

04:42.692 --> 04:44.227
Ichijo?!

04:44.227 --> 04:46.196
What are they talking about?

04:46.196 --> 04:50.133
More importantly, it's amazing she's not
intimidated by that thing at all...

04:50.133 --> 04:51.434
That is true.

04:51.434 --> 04:54.070
She's the person who's not
intimidated of the year!

04:54.070 --> 04:58.875
That's why I've been trying to say
something's wrong with them as reality!

04:58.875 --> 05:00.310
Just calm down!

05:00.310 --> 05:01.911
I AM calm!

05:01.911 --> 05:04.914
I'm probably the calmest one
in the group right now!

05:04.914 --> 05:05.048
Here you go.

05:05.048 --> 05:05.682
Here you go.

05:05.682 --> 05:05.807
Here you go.

05:07.117 --> 05:09.219
You'll relax if you eat it!

05:09.219 --> 05:10.787
Thank you...

05:12.022 --> 05:13.890
Hey, she's back!

05:13.890 --> 05:15.859
We came to an agreement.

05:15.859 --> 05:17.627
What were you talking about with him?

05:17.627 --> 05:19.996
Here's what I told him:

05:19.996 --> 05:23.933
"The person you think is a little kid bancho
is actually a teacher, not a student.

05:23.933 --> 05:26.169
This is a complete misunderstanding."

05:26.169 --> 05:28.038
So you went there to explain the situation.

05:28.038 --> 05:29.506
And?

05:29.506 --> 05:30.974
Then he said regretfully,

05:30.974 --> 05:32.909
"All right, we should withdraw then."

05:32.909 --> 05:37.047
You managed to talk the Bancho
Association out of it, Miss Ichijo!

05:37.047 --> 05:39.482
Mahoho! I think that's awesome!

05:39.482 --> 05:41.785
Thank you, Ichijo! You really saved us!

05:41.785 --> 05:44.220
But it doesn't look like they're leaving, though...

05:44.220 --> 05:44.854
That's true.

05:44.854 --> 05:45.055
That's true.

05:46.289 --> 05:48.258
What's going on, Ichijo?

05:48.258 --> 05:52.862
Well, since he agreed to withdraw so easily

05:52.862 --> 05:55.354
I asked him, "Are you really okay with that?"

05:57.467 --> 06:00.570
Then I added, "Wouldn't it be a disgrace to
the name of the Bancho Association

06:00.570 --> 06:04.507
if you left empty-handed after
you came all the way out here?"

06:04.808 --> 06:06.843
Did you really say that?!

06:06.843 --> 06:08.178
Then what happened?

06:08.178 --> 06:10.814
Then he promised me by saying,
"I understand.

06:10.814 --> 06:17.686
Since you insist, I'll fight that little kid bancho
for the name of the Bancho Association!"

06:18.988 --> 06:24.727
So, Ichijo, basically you're telling us that things
haven't changed for the better at all, right?

06:24.727 --> 06:28.665
Well, actually I think things have
gotten worse than they were before.

06:28.665 --> 06:31.601
You think?! Why you!

06:31.601 --> 06:33.433
Whoa, Becky!

06:36.773 --> 06:38.104
Wait!

06:39.909 --> 06:42.742
Prepare yourself, Rebecca Miyamoto!

06:44.347 --> 06:47.339
Captain, I'm not following the story here.

06:48.651 --> 06:53.423
Then why don't we observe some other
person's behavior today? What do you say?

06:53.423 --> 06:54.858
Let's do that.

06:54.858 --> 06:58.595
Oh, I wonder how Behoimi has
been doing since then.

06:58.595 --> 07:01.326
Yeah. My heart is cold...

07:10.773 --> 07:13.409
Oops, the measurements are wrong.

07:13.409 --> 07:15.810
Oh well, I'm just knitting for the hell of it anyway.

07:18.982 --> 07:21.851
We're very fortunate, aren't we?

07:21.851 --> 07:23.785
Yes, we are, Captain.

07:24.154 --> 07:26.656
...and then you win his heart.

07:26.656 --> 07:29.159
Please help me.

07:29.159 --> 07:31.594
Come on out, you little kid teacher!

07:31.594 --> 07:33.930
Fight me fair and square!

07:33.930 --> 07:35.698
Yeah, that'll definitely work!

07:35.698 --> 07:38.635
What? Are you sure that'll work?

07:38.635 --> 07:42.367
Don't worry! They look pretty simple
at the core, so...

07:42.438 --> 07:43.773
But still...

07:43.773 --> 07:46.442
All right, Miyako. Bring her here for us.

07:46.442 --> 07:48.645
What? I have to go?!

07:48.645 --> 07:50.713
And she'll probably be hesitant,

07:50.713 --> 07:53.148
so take No. 6 with you and force her to come.

07:53.483 --> 07:55.752
I got it! Let's go, Miyako!

07:55.752 --> 07:57.220
