07:57.220 --> 07:59.355
What? What? What were you guys
just talking about?

07:59.355 --> 08:01.024
Pay attention.

08:01.024 --> 08:03.092
Sorry, I was busy eating this rice cracker.

08:03.092 --> 08:04.560
Mahoho!

08:04.661 --> 08:05.929
Um...

08:05.929 --> 08:06.629
