08:06.629 --> 08:08.331
It's Operation: Appeasement.

08:08.331 --> 08:09.532
A-beast-ment? So there's going to be monsters?

08:09.532 --> 08:10.466
A-beast-ment? So there's going to be monsters?

08:10.466 --> 08:13.636
Are they ferocious? Do they shoot fire?
I think I omega want to see it!

08:13.636 --> 08:14.704
