08:14.704 --> 08:18.074
What? I'm wrong? I think that's boring!

08:18.074 --> 08:22.443
It's a strategy to turn that cow-man
Hirosuke into our friend.

08:22.979 --> 08:24.013
Our friend?!

08:24.013 --> 08:26.616
We'll get him under our control
and disrupt the base of their teamwork.

08:26.616 --> 08:29.118
Oh, I see! Then how are you going to do it?

08:29.118 --> 08:30.954
By sending a Goodwill Ambassador.

08:30.954 --> 08:32.655
Goodwill Ambassador?

08:32.655 --> 08:34.749
I don't think that's going to work.

08:35.925 --> 08:37.493
Are you having fun?

08:37.493 --> 08:42.065
No, I'm not. Please help me.

08:42.065 --> 08:42.832
Shhhh.

08:42.832 --> 08:45.268
This is the part where you
really have to flex your muscles.

08:45.268 --> 08:48.033
