08:48.171 --> 08:48.471
Let me go! I'll never do it! Let me go!

08:48.471 --> 08:50.206
Let me go! I'll never do it! Let me go!

08:50.206 --> 08:52.275
Let me go! I'll never do it! Let me go!

08:52.275 --> 08:53.810
Let me go! I'll never do it! Let me go!

08:53.810 --> 08:54.811
