08:54.811 --> 08:56.370
Here comes the heroine!

09:00.650 --> 09:03.586
It looks like she's not going to
come out, dabesa.

09:03.586 --> 09:06.681
I guess we have no choice then.
Should we go over there?

09:08.057 --> 09:09.025
