09:09.025 --> 09:10.925
Mom... Mom...

09:12.862 --> 09:16.232
Wh-Why am I doing something like this?

09:16.232 --> 09:18.268
Good luck, Serizawa!

09:18.268 --> 09:20.760
Capture Hirosuke's heart!

09:22.705 --> 09:24.874
