09:51.601 --> 09:54.161
Sob, sob, sob... Sob, sob, sob...

09:54.470 --> 09:56.973
They think they can mess with me
just because I'm a cow!

09:56.973 --> 09:59.776
All right, we have no choice
but to go there ourselves.

09:59.776 --> 10:01.870
You guys, stay out of this. Got it?

10:05.581 --> 10:08.073
I'm coming for you, little kid teacher!

10:09.185 --> 10:10.386
