10:10.386 --> 10:13.723
Crap, another joke isn't going to cut it!

10:13.723 --> 10:15.124
Hau, hau, hau, hau!

10:15.124 --> 10:15.158
Hau, hau, hau, hau!

10:23.466 --> 10:25.234
No one's here...

10:25.234 --> 10:26.502
