10:26.502 --> 10:27.594
I'm here!

10:29.138 --> 10:30.697
She didn't even see me...

10:38.314 --> 10:39.515
A wig?

10:39.515 --> 10:41.381
A fake... Damn!

10:42.752 --> 10:45.050
That was close!

10:46.222 --> 10:49.559
Akiyama, I know you can get clear away!

10:49.559 --> 10:50.893
You can do this!

10:50.893 --> 10:53.726
You should've told me she's carrying shuriken!

10:58.267 --> 11:00.395
