11:01.070 --> 11:03.971
Where the hell are you hiding?
Little kid teacher!

11:10.780 --> 11:11.848
He's gone.

11:11.848 --> 11:13.049
Hau, hau...

11:13.049 --> 11:15.518
Are you sure we can really get away from them?

11:15.518 --> 11:18.421
If we get caught, we're done for! Haul

11:18.421 --> 11:22.425
Now that it's come to this, the only thing
we can do is find a way to escape the school.

11:22.425 --> 11:23.153
Huh?

11:23.526 --> 11:24.891
