11:25.061 --> 11:26.859
Whoa, this is...

11:31.567 --> 11:34.604
Lalalu... Lalalu...

11:34.604 --> 11:35.838
Are you lonely?

11:35.838 --> 11:36.839
Yeah, I guess.

11:36.839 --> 11:36.939
Yeah, I guess.

