Everyone will be nice to you, kero.

11:42.345 --> 11:42.812
Everyone will be nice to you, kero.

11:42.812 --> 11:45.440
Of course I would if I could...

11:46.716 --> 11:47.842
Stay strong.

11:48.484 --> 11:50.248
Oh, I wish I could just fillet him!

11:57.493 --> 12:01.063
That cow-man, huh?

12:01.063 --> 12:02.698
Oh, I see...

12:02.698 --> 12:04.600
Did you get it, Watanuki?

12:04.600 --> 12:07.270
I found it on the BBS on the
Bancho Association's website.

12:07.270 --> 12:11.040
Apparently, to Hirosuke,
Suzune is almost like God.

12:11.040 --> 12:13.676
God? God, huh...

12:13.676 --> 12:15.845
Does he know anything about Shiratori?

12:15.845 --> 12:17.146
Not at all.

12:17.146 --> 12:19.382
It seems like he doesn't even know
which school she goes to.

12:19.382 --> 12:22.752
He saw her in town one day and fell in love
with her at first sight. That's all!

12:22.752 --> 12:26.756
So it's nothing but a one-way love, huh?
We can use this.

12:26.756 --> 12:28.224
Hey, like I said,

12:28.224 --> 12:31.561
we should just forget about Operation:
Appeasement and get out of here fast.

12:31.561 --> 12:33.796
