12:33.796 --> 12:35.965
It's getting interesting, you know?

12:35.965 --> 12:37.967
I don't think this is interesting at all!

12:37.967 --> 12:40.970
I've been targeted, even though I'm a teacher!

12:40.970 --> 12:42.905
All right, all right. There, there.

12:42.905 --> 12:44.100
All right, all right. There, there.

12:44.841 --> 12:46.342
