13:34.390 --> 13:36.792
I'm double-thrilled!

13:36.792 --> 13:38.726
You're so weird!

13:41.264 --> 13:46.602
Y-You're right! I'm so weird! Yes, I am weird.

13:46.602 --> 13:48.092
There you are!

13:49.171 --> 13:54.200
I finally found you, Hirosuke!
It's me, Suzune Shirato...

13:57.113 --> 14:01.277
I'm flying... Mom, this is the second time...

14:02.151 --> 14:03.119
Serizawa!

14:03.119 --> 14:07.523
What?! W-Was she your friend?!

14:07.523 --> 14:09.258
That was horrible, Mr. Cow!

14:09.258 --> 14:11.594
I-I'm deeply sorry!

14:11.594 --> 14:13.863
A bad boy will get a chop from me!

14:13.863 --> 14:19.435
Huh? Oh, okay... If that's all it takes
for you to forgive me...

14:19.435 --> 14:20.937
Go right ahead!

14:20.937 --> 14:22.171
CHOP!

14:22.171 --> 14:23.104
Suzune!

14:24.440 --> 14:25.508
Wow, you did it!

14:25.508 --> 14:28.544
Suzune's chop of justice explodes!

14:28.544 --> 14:29.211
Huh?

14:29.211 --> 14:33.349
Your chop is the table turner
of the year, Suzune!

14:33.349 --> 14:34.908
Yes, this is great!

14:36.986 --> 14:38.588
I don't really know what's going on,

14:38.588 --> 14:41.490
but it looks like I'm being praised,
so I guess it's all right!

14:41.490 --> 14:43.092
